---
// Bound fields for the patch test; the inline runtime is baked into <head>.
---
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Astro inline preview</title></head>
  <body style="margin:0;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif">
    <h1 data-payload-field="title" data-testid="title">Hello</h1>
    <p data-payload-field="subtitle" data-testid="subtitle">sub</p>
  </body>
</html>
